		(property "Footprint" "Capacitor_SMD:C_0402_1005Metric" (at 226.06 177.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
		(property "Design Note" "VA monitor reservoir at the MCU PA7 pin; same reason as C32. Source is R24||R25 = 17.2k since R25 went 47k -> 27k on 2026-09-12 (it was 23.5k after the 2026-09-05 BOM pass and 5k before that). Still far above the 5k this note originally assumed, so the conclusion is unchanged: this reservoir is MORE load-bearing, not less, because it is what absorbs the ADC's sampling kick at the higher source impedance" (at 226.06 177.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
