		(property "MPN" "SRN6028C-4R7M" (at 147.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
		(property "Design Note" "DS41326 Table 2 gives 3.9 uH for the AP63203 at 3.3 V, against Table 3's 4.7 uH for the AP63205 at 5 V. 4.7 uH is KEPT DELIBERATELY: the datasheet's own inductor section recommends 2.2-10 uH and says to USE A LARGER INDUCTANCE FOR IMPROVED EFFICIENCY UNDER LIGHT LOAD, which is this board's entire operating point (~3 mA). Keeping it also avoids re-opening the L_6.3x6.3_H3 land mismatch recorded in FAB-NOTES. Bourns 4.7uH +/-20%, Isat 3.2A, Irms 3.1A, DCR 30mOhm" (at 147.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
